{"availability":"available","full":"AminCoder/DCL","name":"DCL","description":" DCL  :: One-way encryption with Key and Alpha ","category":"Other","language":"JavaScript","stars":2,"forks":0,"created":"2024-02-17T11:53:39Z","updated":"2024-02-17T16:46:27Z","license":"GPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":[],"demo":"https://amincoder.ir/dcl","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T19:18:05.907Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T19:18:05.907Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T19:18:05.907Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T14:33:02.080Z","stars":2,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-04T16:11:53.752Z","stars":2,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-06T16:32:25.570Z","stars":2,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-08T20:09:54.667Z","stars":2,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-11T11:06:21.998Z","stars":2,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-15T11:20:22.783Z","stars":2,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-18T19:18:05.907Z","stars":2,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["DCL(Data Capping Layer) cryptography is a one-way hash algorithm which is 96 characters long.","The difference between this algorithm and other one-way encryption algorithms like SHA and MD5 is in defining KEY and ALPHA. In this case, you will be protected from usual kinds of attacks like Collision Attack, BruteForce and etc.","The DCL algorithm is designed such that it is necessary to have KEY and ALPHA at the same time for developing online dictionaries and maps. Therefore because of this, mentioned attacks which are very expensive will be unsuccessful in decrypting mentioned cryptographies. Other attraction of DCL is that because you are involved in the process of securing your contacts’ data, even simple passwords and data like “12345” are unpredictable."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/AminCoder/DCL/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"d9eefd83b2a840d7bb1d8acc838ac650c3665168643e3fc12c8ccc8ab3571332","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T06:26:23.663Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T19:18:06.0